OL,3,GNEWSAPlan submitted for 'exciting' #8m
OL,4,Atheatre upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for an #8m refurbishment of a
OL,7,Ftheatre in Leicestershire have been
OL,8,Fannounced.
OL,10,FThe Concordia Theatre in Hinckley has
OL,11,Fsubmitted an outline planning
OL,12,Fapplication to Hinckley and Bosworth
OL,13,FBorough Council to refurbish the site
OL,14,Fat Stockwell Head.
OL,16,FThe scheme, which includes refurbishing
OL,17,Fthe auditorium, is part of the
OL,18,Ftheatre's Project 2030 initiative,
OL,19,Fwhich aims to upgrade the site for
OL,20,Ffuture generations, according to the
OL,21,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service
OL,22,F(LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
