OL,3,GNEWSAPlan submitted for 'exciting' #8m
OL,4,Atheatre upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Chamberlain, trustee for Hinckley
OL,7,FConcordia Association, told the LDRS
OL,8,Fthe "exciting plans" were submitted in
OL,9,Fthe hope of securing future funding for
OL,10,Fthe community-led theatre.
